le="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;冰雹和冬季天气导致中西部和西部山区的发病率上升，其中科罗拉多州、犹他州和明尼苏达州最为突出。东南部一些州的财产税是全国最低的，那里的保险费现在可以达到税收的 2.5 到 4 倍。东北部和西部各州以及大都市地区缴纳高额税款，这使得不断上涨的保险费在税单中所占的比例较小。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/KfC-5bhGIMFbbHC5S3dovSZI2doHDlkZ5wrl0Zpie4sln5sQSRHWL8TvLtXGiG05Z3od3V6lmp3hBhZ7HWWlVhBw0uM71U-BwQqItY_FkcY8Lcd68-ZIiw4O9yPDQe2mtBLIAzWsUfaxi9F4C9njhS2fqcUtG80GaYmO4LPg4m7ufz_RFVAy9Av7TGNaaAwZp73IaNwWjoZ_zmVLg3k-GgUxCj0UiMv3pTODgYP-z4rbr88vkBad33zBSSS3L_ZBxvIKxpy0ue8lt7kRFOYqOCiVEaWmGZrqBh-mx2FXtJjJ7wEAHKo9sE4vOQPam05-E74U6uIMvZikkLMG72F6Y0riTsPoP7-xBsntBfixI62RjhbkfynG4IRQv8pfXFg4Co4vXdAJNWYY5LjQb4nRrZF0-6G2fZAnlczrPnXpavO3l9srXCPewMYfg-8vCl8vvlF7M0qwMY7-yvIEMLOO4_7HDpATpfthxaaJohiWexKcVIwXvj2Yv3uaZ1kiNOqAJrWvwH5x4UG_YkRQk__6_e7rOvyzyrDLGunrqpJL33JH6J7jPwanGkDPwg/IhcN7fNOl7-R_5_YLX_btltgnlyLBVaA/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e; text-decoration: none !important;" target="_blank" title="家庭保险是美国家庭最紧缩的财产税"&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; margin: 24px 0 0 0; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; font-size: 14px !important; color: #000 !important; text-decoration: none !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;格林的更多作品&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top: 24px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/BJNcHYGlFv6qEkPYveqoBg2vZF7wl7Yei-rUzsXzg5fGtaYnz1aJyh6SjnsvGTutaA8j2-qvtoNrVDcLaveMMya7EJXoH1AW59ttF0QL1YWUSUBJCv-jWfrIm7gRYUS1K8JZJXwI4CrXj4kUJLISh7DGmmo4BtlnUkIKukaRCLzKmuZVsoW2GDiYjhXc1TLG2ga9GjRLPmLh93VSlrWoXMGwcLsjZqk84PwzEnLydwVsrS_HcVmAzOGDnke3S_XLQ1-d8olVXjgLXL4AzAoyzQqhmKdqiJXld6c2Zgb3hpef71Ci3hmRaJHk3Dzhcxf9_tTbdhrHacNv6SxkvQztkXeEoJeT61pLSsof_obo4m0qPU2tUJ-_CyWIXo9LRSptPXr0slVlHHPiAk41W79G6Iou3vBZz-l1KkKB0_w-2J53-Y4t5v0X62ivX0vQt6LjbIvcRE5uVFPG_1Z-0HQ8i03fYeS5kyP_rT0up7YmegNQb2JeXjtbHhTy